            <div xml:id="d424">

                <pb facs="0633" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1925v02/pg551"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/1624: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Sheffield</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-12-22T11:00:00-07:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 22,
                                1925—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:20
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>291. My telegram number 287 December 19.<anchor n="51" xml:id="d424-f1"/> Chamber
                    of Deputies last night passed petroleum bill with Senate amendments. Bill thus
                    passed by Congress now goes to the President for approval. See last sentence my
                    telegram number 280 December 16, 5 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sheffield</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
